== Metal Blocks ==
[[file:metalblock.png|52px|link=]]
* Blocks movement and projectiles.
* An explosion's blast radius will not extend past it.
* {{dlc|nr}} Cannot be destroyed or removed.
* {{dlc+|r}} Can only be destroyed by walking over while {{i|Mega Mush}} is active.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|a}} Can be re-rolled by the {{i|D12}} into a destructible obstacle.{{dlc-}}
* Can only be moved over via [[flight|flying]] or [[jump]]ing.

== Key Blocks ==
[[file:keyblock.png|48px|link=]]
* Acts like [[#Metal Block|Metal Blocks]].
* Requires a [[key]] to unlock.
* Cannot be [[flight|flown]] over.
* Small chance to drop a random [[pickup]] when unlocked.
* {{dlc+|r}} Can be destroyed with a bomb explosion if {{t|Broken Padlock}} is held.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Can be destroyed without consuming a key by walking over while {{i|Mega Mush}} is active.{{dlc-}}

== Pillars {{dlc|r}} ==
[[File:Pillars.png|200px|link=]]
* Blocks movement and projectiles like a regular block.
* Cannot be [[flight|flown]] over, nor can flying enemies or familiars fly over it.
* Obstructs vision of the tile above it.
** Some rooms will seem to have an inaccessible pickup, but there is actually an [[Event Plate]] hidden on the top tile of the pillar.
** Some other rooms may also have a [[Kill Plate]] hidden behind it.

